{"strongs": "H8593", "word": "תַּ֫עַר", "translit": "ta.ar", "root": "ערב", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "razor, sheath", "definition": "תַּ֫עַר noun masculine Ps 52:4 and ( Isa 7:20 ) feminine razor, sheath ; — 1. a. razor , absolute ׳ יְגַלַּח בְּת Isa 7:20 (figurative); subject of לֹא יַעֲבֹר עַלרֿאֹשׁ Num 6:5 , object of הֶעֱבִיר עַלֿ Num 8:7 ( P ), compare construct הַגַּלָּבִים ׳ ת Ezek 5:1 absolute מְלֻטָּשׁ ׳ כְּת Ps 52:4 (simile of tongue). \\ \\ b. construct הַסֹּפֵר ׳ ת Jer 36:23 = penknife . 2. sheath , always suffix of sword: בְּתַעְרָהּ 2Sam 20:8 of drawing sword, ׳ שָׁלַף מִתּ 1Sam 17:51 , ׳ הוֺצִיא מִתּ Ezek 21:8 ; Ezek 21:10 , ׳ תֵּצֵא מִתּ v. Ezek 21:9 of sheathing, הֵאָֽסְפִי אֶלתַּֿרְעֵךְ Jer 47:6 הָשַׁב אֶלתַּֿעְרָהּ Ezek 21:35 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6379')\">BDB6379</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8593')\">H8593</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6378')\">BDB6378</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6380')\">BDB6380</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תַּ֫עַר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ps 52:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,4)\">Ps 52:4</ref></sup> and (<ref ref=\"Isa 7:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,20)\">Isa 7:20</ref>) <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>razor, sheath</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>razor</highlight>, absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְגַלַּח בְּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,20)\">Isa 7:20</ref> (figurative); subject of <bdbheb>לֹא יַעֲבֹר עַלרֿאֹשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 6:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,5)\">Num 6:5</ref>, object of <bdbheb>הֶעֱבִיר עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">